{"suttaId":"tha-ap482","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1815,1838],"vripara":"90"},"segments":{"tha-ap482:0.3":"Pulinacaṅkamiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap482:1.1":"“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, araññe kānane ahaṃ;","tha-ap482:1.3":"Vātamigaṃ gavesanto, caṅkamaṃ addasaṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap482:2.1":"“Ucchaṅgena pulinaṃ [puḷinaṃ (sī. syā. pī. ka.)] gayha, caṅkame okiriṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap482:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, sugatassa sirīmato.","tha-ap482:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, pulinaṃ okiriṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap482:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pulinassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap482:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap482:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap482:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap482:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pulinacaṅkamiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap482:8.1":"Pulinacaṅkamiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap482:9.1":"Naḷamālivaggo aṭṭhacattālīsamo.","tha-ap482:10.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap482:11.1":"Naḷamālī maṇidado, ukkāsatikabījanī;","tha-ap482:11.3":"Kummāso ca kusaṭṭho ca, giripunnāgiyopi ca.","tha-ap482:12.1":"Vallikāro pānadhido, atho pulinacaṅkamo;","tha-ap482:12.3":"Gāthāyo pañcanavuti, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhi."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
